    "==> README.md <==
# my-app

A client-rendered SignalX app on Vite. Scaffolded by \`npm create @sigx\` (spa).

## Getting started

\`\`\`sh
pnpm install
pnpm dev
\`\`\`

## Scripts

- \`pnpm build\` — production build
- \`pnpm preview\` — preview the production build

## Project layout

- \`src/main.tsx\` — mounts the app (\`defineApp(<App />).mount('#app')\`)
- \`src/App.tsx\` — the root component; edit it and watch HMR update the page
- \`src/styles.css\` — global styles

## Learn more

- [SignalX docs](https://sigx.dev)
- [GitHub](https://github.com/signalxjs)
",
