    "==> README.md <==
# my-app

A client-rendered SignalX app on Vite. Scaffolded by \`npm create @sigx\` (spa + daisyui).

## Getting started

\`\`\`sh
npm install
npm run dev
\`\`\`

## Scripts

- \`npm run build\` — production build
- \`npm run preview\` — preview the production build

## Project layout

- \`src/main.tsx\` — mounts the app (\`defineApp(<App />).mount('#app')\`)
- \`src/App.tsx\` — the root component; edit it and watch HMR update the page
- \`src/styles.css\` — global styles

## Styling

Tailwind CSS 4 + daisyUI 5. Themes are declared in \`src/styles.css\` (\`@plugin "daisyui" { themes: … }\`); set \`data-theme\` on \`<html>\` to switch.

\`@sigx/daisyui\` ships ready-made components (\`Button\`, \`Card\`, \`Modal\`, \`ThemeSelector\`, …) — see https://sigx.dev/daisyui/.

## Learn more

- [SignalX docs](https://sigx.dev)
- [GitHub](https://github.com/signalxjs)
",
