    "==> README.md <==
# my-app

A terminal UI built with \`@sigx/terminal\` — TSX and signals, with an HMR dev runner. Scaffolded by \`npm create @sigx\` (terminal).

## Getting started

\`\`\`sh
pnpm install
pnpm dev
\`\`\`

## Scripts

- \`pnpm start\` — run the production build

## Project layout

- \`src/main.tsx\` — the mount module (\`defineApp(<App />).mount(…, terminalMount)\`)
- \`src/App.tsx\` — the root component; save it and the running TUI updates in place

Interactive apps need a real terminal (TTY). Piping the output (\`| cat\`) prints a single plain-text frame instead.

## Learn more

- [SignalX docs](https://sigx.dev)
- [GitHub](https://github.com/signalxjs)
